========================================================================
  THE 1/k RECIPROCAL IN THE CYCLE INDEX
========================================================================

  THE 1/k FACTOR IN THE CYCLE INDEX:

  For cycle type (k, 1^{n-k}): aut = k × 1^{n-k} × (n-k)! = k(n-k)!
  mult = n! / aut = n!/(k(n-k)!) = C(n,k) × (k-1)!
  Note: C(n,k)×(k-1)! = (n!/(k!(n-k)!)) × (k-1)! = n!/(k(n-k)!)
  = (1/k) × n!/(n-k)!

  So the contribution to R(n) from a single k-cycle is:
  R_k(n) = (1/k) × (n!/(n-k)!) × 2^{(k-1)(k+1-2n)/2 - m} × ... no.

  More precisely:
  R_k(n) = C(n,k) × (k-1)! × 2^{Delta_k}
         = (1/k) × n!/(n-k)! × 2^{(k-1)(k+1-2n)/2}

  R_k(n) × k = n!/(n-k)! × 2^{(k-1)(k+1-2n)/2}:

  n= 3: k=3: 4.500000e+00
  n= 4: k=3: 4.500000e+00
  n= 5: k=3: 2.812500e+00 k=5: 2.343750e+00
  n= 6: k=3: 1.406250e+00 k=5: 8.789062e-01
  n= 7: k=3: 6.152344e-01 k=5: 1.922607e-01 k=7: 1.345825e-01
  n= 8: k=3: 2.460938e-01 k=5: 3.204346e-02 k=7: 1.682281e-02
  n= 9: k=3: 9.228516e-02 k=5: 4.506111e-03 k=7: 1.182854e-03
  n=10: k=3: 3.295898e-02 k=5: 5.632639e-04 k=7: 6.160699e-05
  n=11: k=3: 1.132965e-02 k=5: 6.454065e-05 k=7: 2.647175e-06
  n=12: k=3: 3.776550e-03 k=5: 6.915070e-06 k=7: 9.926907e-08
  n=13: k=3: 1.227379e-03 k=5: 7.023118e-07 k=7: 3.360672e-09

